# Read an exit plan

/assets/floor-plan.png
alt: Floor plan showing the north exit beside the meeting room
size: small
alignment: left
float: left

Find the north exit on the plan. Keep the route clear before work begins.

close: float

/assets/exit-route.png
alt: Diagram showing a clear route to the south exit
size: medium
alignment: right
float: right

Follow the marked route to the south exit when the north exit is blocked.

close: float

